{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id348479092"}, "name":{"label":"The Reviewer 00001"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-21T15:18:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.0"}, "id":{"label":"13540365136"}, "title":{"label":"My OCD organisation loves this <3"}, "content":{"label":"I was looking for an app that wasn’t too lengthy or created more work for me, just to be able to add tasks and tick them off (this is something I obsessively do in my notes app already) BUT I’d sometimes forget to do tasks at a certain time / day, so needed a reminder & didn’t want to have to set alarms for it. This app is PERFECT. Within a couple of seconds I can add my task, select the date and time - and I automatically get the reminder as well as the moment to cross it off of my completed list. Thanks!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id322540038"}, "name":{"label":"HeteronomousFB"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-20T04:14:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.0"}, "id":{"label":"13534578821"}, "title":{"label":"Basic and Clunky"}, "content":{"label":"Edit:  because  of the issues I asked for a refund and to their credit (and literally mine!) they refunded the payment. ——————————————I thought this might be good for a small business, but having paid for a ‘Pro’ sub in order to use the ‘repeat task’ and created a few daily repeating tasks, none actually repeated. Not clear how to add repeat (again) to existing task, but this is just one example of clunkiness. Otherwise needs a lot of clicking to operate. Cancelled my sub immediately but money already taken! £5.99 for one day of poor use! Compared to e.g. Aeon or even Things it’s all really rather primitive.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1559189209"}, "name":{"label":"Oreothebun4"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-18T14:21:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.0"}, "id":{"label":"13528938724"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing!"}, "content":{"label":"I have ADHD so this is an amazing creation so I don’t forget things and keeps me motivated and focused throughout my day! Would defo recommend! I feel like they should have some more colours in the app and make it more clear what the task I have set is when you enter the app, but other than that this app is literally perfect! :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id19996433"}, "name":{"label":"Bradyzzzz"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-09T10:49:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.12"}, "id":{"label":"13494607685"}, "title":{"label":"Good layout"}, "content":{"label":"I've been searching for a good to-do app for quite some time.  I tried Structured and it seemed easy to use and had interesting features, however not sure it was really what I was after and the free trial was only 3-days so didn't have enough time to explore.  Deleted after day 2.  Also  I tried the AI which didn't seem to help with what I wanted .", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id471363426"}, "name":{"label":"rpow593"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-04T01:18:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.12"}, "id":{"label":"13473299830"}, "title":{"label":"Now too expensive and poor watch app"}, "content":{"label":"The price has shot up recently meaning it is now too expensive for me. The business model of apps like this is to get people reliant on it and then hike the prices. Also, notifications do not work in the watch app unless you are connected to your phone. This is a major oversight. Many people now leave the house with just their watch.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id474451489"}, "name":{"label":"stxrawbie"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-01T03:33:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.11"}, "id":{"label":"13462169484"}, "title":{"label":"such a useful app !!"}, "content":{"label":"this has become my daily list to check in with, it is so useful and the shortcuts options make things so smooth\n\ni would love for there to be an option to delete a task through shortcuts without having to confirm in a notification, since this is possible with built in reminders and would make automating things much smoother\n\nand i also hope the ability to re-order all day tasks come back … i have no clue why they removed that in the first place, sometimes you can do it and sometimes not, it’s very intermittent and if it does work it’s never on today’s date. it only works on the macbook when in full screen mode so honestly it feels like an oversight with how inconsistent it is\n\nanddd i wish we could turn the new weekly timeline view off … its way too easy to accidentally scroll to when trying to switch between days or re order tasks, and then it’s hard to get out of because you end up accidentally scrolling through your tasks instead of dismissing the mode entirely\n\nthese are small things though !! most of these issues caused by the massive update in september. hopefully these things can be improved and resolved soon to make it less frustrating, because the core experience has been so good for me !!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id408934144"}, "name":{"label":"Nadebrazier"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-24T04:27:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.11"}, "id":{"label":"13435265086"}, "title":{"label":"App has become unusable"}, "content":{"label":"I got this app over summer to help organise and plan my days and it was honestly really well made and easy to use. The UI was easy to navigate and adding tasks was a breeze.\n\nHowever, since the update I’ve been finding it a lot harder to streamline my plans on the app and often when I’m trying to type out my task, the keyboard disappears every few letters I type. More recently, the app has been crashing every time I try to add, edit or type out a task, making the app completely unusable. Maybe this is not entirely the apps fault, but I am unsure as all these issues only started with the most recent updates.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
