{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1656656015"}, "name":{"label":"Harley Welsh"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-28T07:40:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.7"}, "id":{"label":"13325435559"}, "title":{"label":"Life Changing"}, "content":{"label":"This is the first app I’ve ever reviewed, purely out of need to state how much this app has changed how I navigate my life. All because of one killer feature:\n\nTime between tasks.\n\nIf you have two tasks that are some time apart, the app will tell you how much time that is. Me being me, I then try and fill it with some other task. I find myself actively looking around and trying to find something productive to do to fill that time.\n\nI’ve probably done about 3 days worth of work in 1.\n\nEssentially, this is compression, for your routine. \n\n100% give this app a go, if you have the right attitude, it can change everything.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
