{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id139117911"}, "name":{"label":"Adi Moon"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-15T16:49:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.4"}, "id":{"label":"13271618720"}, "title":{"label":"Awful Inbox limits it"}, "content":{"label":"This would be the perfect app if it had an inbox with ability to prioritise, search, order, use folders. But it's just one giant list and has been for years. Unmanageable for more than 10 tasks.\n\nFocus timer flow on watch like Routinery would also be a step up.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1844160969"}, "name":{"label":"Cissy888"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-15T04:29:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.4"}, "id":{"label":"13269169038"}, "title":{"label":"Used to love it now it’s broken"}, "content":{"label":"When I first got this app I instantly fell in love with the design and structure. I loved the use of customisable colours and symbols. But now I can’t change that, I am unable to open the tab that allows me to do this, it won’t open properly and it’s a real shame because I’ve found this app so useful, but now the fun has been taken away", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id234152178"}, "name":{"label":"tiihuynh"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-14T14:37:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.4"}, "id":{"label":"13267048062"}, "title":{"label":"new update has ruined the app"}, "content":{"label":"the new update has made it so much harder, clunkier and slower to update or add a new task. the old update was a lot better - please change it back as it’s unbearable to use", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id133386462"}, "name":{"label":"Bonno89"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-11T01:13:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.4"}, "id":{"label":"13251595433"}, "title":{"label":"Updates ruining an app"}, "content":{"label":"This app is the perfect example of why you don’t just keep updating things for the sake of it. Every update in the last 6 months has made the app slower, uglier, less functional, made features worse or just unusable.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
