{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id35541304"}, "name":{"label":"Meclke"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-04T00:53:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.3"}, "id":{"label":"13221437455"}, "title":{"label":"My favourite!"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve had this app for years and use it integrated with my iCal & Reminders in addition to using it as my daily planner to get my stuff done and utilising the inbox to keep track of those random things you remember at the most inconvenient of times!\n\nOn my days off I use it to plan out the things I need to get done and use the focus tool to hold me to account but also to demonstrate both the progress of the task and provide the pressure of the deadline which my brain lives for.\n\nI use to manually readjust my day, as the nature of life means things will need adapting but now you also have the replan function to make that even easier.\n\nI’ve tried many an app, some free, some costly.  I’ve repeatedly returned to this one, as none of them meet my needs as simply and intuitively as Structured. Thank you!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1699559230"}, "name":{"label":"Keira230"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-01T10:01:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.3"}, "id":{"label":"13210072367"}, "title":{"label":"New Update"}, "content":{"label":"New update is preventing me from reaching the colour and Icon changer, which I find very important\n\nThe box is now tiny and I can't use it and please may you fix it", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1031595654"}, "name":{"label":"Benjizp4"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-01T07:43:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.3"}, "id":{"label":"13209531095"}, "title":{"label":"Great app, one big problem"}, "content":{"label":"I gave it one star just so hopefully you guys see this. When you click to create a new task, depending on where the app is on your home screen, the popup for you to actually add the task to your day is sometimes hidden below the macOS dock, so you can’t click it. Please fix this bug, everything else is good.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id165242149"}, "name":{"label":"Davinaisnotimpressed"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-30T03:29:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.2"}, "id":{"label":"13204044456"}, "title":{"label":"From 5* to 1*"}, "content":{"label":"This app was life changing for me; easy, fun, quick, efficient, ADHD and user friendly.  Since recent update, I am struggling with it.  It’s confusing, takes longer, double, treble click, why? I like the idea of changing days either way full view calendar pop up instead of scrolling to the new date, but ruined by a messy calendar filled with notifications and agenda ms in the boxes, terrifying for ADHD to see.  I understand the need to update, but why make it 10 times longer and harder, please adjust asap so I can use this app with ease, rather than having g to figure out each move", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
